hared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","review_id":"Y4AYncLWF7wzEy4fSogG1Q","date":"2017-11-28T21:44:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9382653832435608,"text_excerpt":"Came here to hear one of my favorite local bands. Had to pay a $15 cover, and the drinks were just about as expensive if you wanted some kind of specialty. The place is a standard style concert venue - a raised stage, a lot of open space to dance or stand around, and a few bar table tops that you can crowd around, or score a seat if you're lucky. There was conflicting information from the Blue Nile and from the band about timing so I ended up completely missing the band I had wanted to see, however, it was still a fun night with good music."},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","review_id":"R-yvsO3ENUHBOwkH7hn3uA","date":"2016-10-01T22:09:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9332363605499268,"text_excerpt":"We came here two nights in a row while visiting NOLA. The first night was reggae night (Thursday), which was kind of quiet (and not what we expected) but still fun. The next night was more active with about 5 different bands playing that night, both on the main floor and upstairs. Both floors were fun and spacious, and crowds were having fun. The balcony was also nice, which looked over almost all of Frenchmen Street. Drinks were reasonably priced too! I would definitely come back to this spot again when visiting NOLA!"},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","review_id":"GARHkBscu6UzUFJGvn0IMg","date":"2014-04-05T01:54:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296779632568359,"text_excerpt":"Blue Nile is my favorite venue on Frenchmen and one of my favorite in the city. I have to admit that the 4 or 5 times I've been there were for specific bands that I already knew and loved, so that was bound to make me like the place more than average, but I think this location in particular made the experience even better. The service here is good to great. For one show I attended, I arrived nice and early (just before 10 so I wouldn't have to pay cover) and stayed through 2 awesome bands, coming to at least 3 hours. By halfway through the night, the bartender knew me and I just had to give her a nod and a fresh brew came my way. This was especially awesome since there were always a bunch..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","photo_id":"vbnaP_xANLN--8nSdURjiA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vbnaP_xANLN--8nSdURjiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9623486399650574},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","photo_id":"Gevkh0C1OdXEG06JzD1oSg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Gevkh0C1OdXEG06JzD1oSg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8933395147323608},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","photo_id":"wYug6zfE9NicviZN7rhzfA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wYug6zfE9NicviZN7rhzfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8726062178611755},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","photo_id":"isA0WCEdkubdD4iDxVq3ZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/isA0WCEdkubdD4iDxVq3ZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8721166849136353},{"business_id":"SmeMEWPwb5vl4m0UbYnugA","photo_id":"7rWvFyt5e3a053G3vp1uDA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7rWvFyt5e3a053G3vp1uDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8334868550300598}]},"notebook_case":null}
